{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the speed and impact of <i>ASURA THE STRIKER</i> \u2014 through sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This official soundtrack features a handpicked selection of music from the game, including intense main stage themes and powerful boss battle tracks.<br>Punchy rhythms and edgy melodies inspired by the golden age of arcade games will elevate your battle experience to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current release includes tracks already featured in the game, and we plan to add all in-use tracks in future updates.<br>We're also actively working on new music, which will be added to both the game and the soundtrack as they\u2019re completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-energy collection crafted with love for '80s\u2013'90s arcade sound.<br>Available in MP3 format, with FLAC versions to be included in future updates. Enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681130?t=1751050303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681130?t=1751050303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681130/d52153c47f70ac97dd2d1bc1b86bbcd34f108a12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751050303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681130/d52153c47f70ac97dd2d1bc1b86bbcd34f108a12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751050303","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the speed and impact of <i>ASURA THE STRIKER</i> \u2014 through sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This official soundtrack features a handpicked selection of music from the game, including intense main stage themes and powerful boss battle tracks.<br>Punchy rhythms and edgy melodies inspired by the golden age of arcade games will elevate your battle experience to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current release in